EMA Lightning Turkish text-to-speech, bundled for on-device use.

- EMA Lightning model weights by canberkkkkkk, Apache-2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/canberkkkkkk/ema-lightning
- ONNX conversion (text.onnx, sound.onnx, decoder.onnx, meta.json) from ema-lightning-web, Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/ozcancelik/ema-lightning-web
- tts/frontend.ts and tts/engine.ts port the text handling, chunking and frame timeline of the
  ema-lightning Python package and ema-lightning-web (both Apache-2.0); the number reader replaces
  normalizer-tr.

See LICENSE for the Apache License 2.0. The voice is AI-generated.
